{"id":50335,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50335"},"modified":"2026-09-19T12:39:46","modified_gmt":"2026-09-19T11:39:46","slug":"corrida-sporting","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-sporting\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida Sporting 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida Sporting 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida Sporting 2026<\/strong> (14\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se nos dias <strong>14 e 15 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, convidando-te a pintar as ruas de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong> com as cores verde e branca. Promovida pela <strong>Funda\u00e7\u00e3o Sporting<\/strong> com organiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da prestigiada <strong>HMS Sports<\/strong>, a emblem\u00e1tica prova regressa ao m\u00edtico relvado do <strong>Est\u00e1dio Jos\u00e9 Alvalade<\/strong>, acolhendo mais de 15.000 participantes numa celebra\u00e7\u00e3o \u00edmpar de desporto, sa\u00fade, solidariedade e paix\u00e3o leonina.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">No s\u00e1bado \u00e0 tarde, as emo\u00e7\u00f5es come\u00e7am com a <strong>Corrida Jubas<\/strong> dedicada aos mais novos (dos 5 aos 13 anos), com partidas na Pra\u00e7a Promenade e chegada triunfal no est\u00e1dio. No domingo de manh\u00e3, a partir da <strong>Alameda da Universidade<\/strong>, decorre a competitiva <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (com passagem pelo Campo Grande, t\u00faneis da Av. da Rep\u00fablica, Saldanha e Pavilh\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o Rocha) e a participativa <strong>Caminhada Fam\u00edlia Leonina de 4 km<\/strong>. Ambas as dist\u00e2ncias culminam com a entrada pela Porta da Maratona e o corte da meta no tapete verde de Alvalade, garantindo abastecimentos oficiais, dorsal personalizado, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica Nike e medalha de finalista.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">14 e 15 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Alameda da Universidade \/ Est\u00e1dio Jos\u00e9 Alvalade, Lisboa, Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 km, 4 km e Kids<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Funda\u00e7\u00e3o Sporting e HMS Sports Consulting<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">2 horas (limite \u00e0s 12h30)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.corridadosporting.pt\/site\/?local=regulations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida Sporting 10K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:15<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 30 de Setembro (S\u00f3cios \/ N\u00e3o S\u00f3cios):<\/strong> 17.00 \u20ac \/ 19.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (30\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1 a 15 de Outubro (S\u00f3cios \/ N\u00e3o S\u00f3cios):<\/strong> 19.00 \u20ac \/ 21.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (15\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">16 de Outubro a 1 de Novembro (S\u00f3cios \/ N\u00e3o S\u00f3cios):<\/strong> 21.00 \u20ac \/ 23.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2 a 14 de Novembro (S\u00f3cios \/ N\u00e3o S\u00f3cios):<\/strong> 23.00 \u20ac \/ 25.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (14\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Fam\u00edlia Leonina 4K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:15<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 30 de Setembro (S\u00f3cios \/ N\u00e3o S\u00f3cios):<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac \/ 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (30\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1 a 15 de Outubro (S\u00f3cios \/ N\u00e3o S\u00f3cios):<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac \/ 17.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (15\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">16 de Outubro a 1 de Novembro (S\u00f3cios \/ N\u00e3o S\u00f3cios):<\/strong> 17.00 \u20ac \/ 19.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2 a 14 de Novembro (S\u00f3cios \/ N\u00e3o S\u00f3cios):<\/strong> 19.00 \u20ac \/ 21.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (14\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Jovem<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida Jubas (Crian\u00e7as)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00danica (Bambis, Benjamins e Infantis):<\/strong> 8.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (14\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida Sporting 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento desportivo decorre no fim de semana de 14 e 15 de novembro de 2026 em Lisboa. No s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro, realiza-se a Corrida Jubas \u00e0s 16:00 junto ao Est\u00e1dio Jos\u00e9 Alvalade. No domingo, 15 de novembro, a Caminhada Fam\u00edlia Leonina de 4 km parte \u00e0s 09:15 e a Corrida de 10 km arranca \u00e0s 10:15 na Alameda da Universidade, ambas com meta no relvado do Est\u00e1dio Jos\u00e9 Alvalade.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e quem pode participar?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa oferece a Corrida de 10 km (exclusiva para atletas com 18 anos ou mais \u00e0 data da prova), a Caminhada Fam\u00edlia Leonina de 4 km (aberta a todas as idades sem classifica\u00e7\u00e3o) e a Corrida Jubas para crian\u00e7as nascidas entre 2013 e 2021 (dist\u00e2ncias de 300m a 1000m por escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e prazos para a prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na Corrida de 10 km os valores variam entre 17,00 \u20ac e 23,00 \u20ac para s\u00f3cios do Sporting e entre 19,00 \u20ac e 25,00 \u20ac para n\u00e3o s\u00f3cios (com op\u00e7\u00e3o de kit 2 com corta-vento e gola por valor adicional). Na Caminhada 4 km o valor varia de 13,00 \u20ac a 19,00 \u20ac para s\u00f3cios e de 15,00 \u20ac a 21,00 \u20ac para n\u00e3o s\u00f3cios. A Corrida Jubas tem o valor fixo de 8,00 \u20ac. O limite global \u00e9 de 15.000 inscritos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios decorre o levantamento do kit do atleta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A entrega dos kits de participante realiza-se na Loja Verde do Est\u00e1dio Jos\u00e9 Alvalade na quinta-feira (12 de novembro), sexta-feira (13 de novembro) e s\u00e1bado (14 de novembro), sempre entre as 10:00 e as 20:00. N\u00e3o haver\u00e1 entrega de kits no domingo da prova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como \u00e9 feita a cronometragem e o acesso aos blocos de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Apenas a Corrida de 10 km disp\u00f5e de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip descart\u00e1vel fixado no dorsal. A partida \u00e9 organizada por blocos de ritmo (Elite, Sub45, Sub50, Sub60 e +60 minutos), sendo obrigat\u00f3ria a apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o de comprovativo de tempo em prova oficial nos \u00faltimos 2 anos para acesso aos blocos mais r\u00e1pidos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Corrida Sporting 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Alameda da Universidade \/ Est\u00e1dio Jos\u00e9 Alvalade\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Funda\u00e7\u00e3o Sporting e HMS Sports Consulting\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida Sporting 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento desportivo decorre no fim de semana de 14 e 15 de novembro de 2026 em Lisboa. No s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro, realiza-se a Corrida Jubas \u00e0s 16:00 junto ao Est\u00e1dio Jos\u00e9 Alvalade. No domingo, 15 de novembro, a Caminhada Fam\u00edlia Leonina de 4 km parte \u00e0s 09:15 e a Corrida de 10 km arranca \u00e0s 10:15 na Alameda da Universidade, ambas com meta no relvado do Est\u00e1dio Jos\u00e9 Alvalade.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e quem pode participar?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa oferece a Corrida de 10 km (exclusiva para atletas com 18 anos ou mais \u00e0 data da prova), a Caminhada Fam\u00edlia Leonina de 4 km (aberta a todas as idades sem classifica\u00e7\u00e3o) e a Corrida Jubas para crian\u00e7as nascidas entre 2013 e 2021 (dist\u00e2ncias de 300m a 1000m por escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e prazos para a prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na Corrida de 10 km os valores variam entre 17,00 \u20ac e 23,00 \u20ac para s\u00f3cios do Sporting e entre 19,00 \u20ac e 25,00 \u20ac para n\u00e3o s\u00f3cios (com op\u00e7\u00e3o de kit 2 com corta-vento e gola por valor adicional). Na Caminhada 4 km o valor varia de 13,00 \u20ac a 19,00 \u20ac para s\u00f3cios e de 15,00 \u20ac a 21,00 \u20ac para n\u00e3o s\u00f3cios. A Corrida Jubas tem o valor fixo de 8,00 \u20ac. O limite global \u00e9 de 15.000 inscritos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios decorre o levantamento do kit do atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A entrega dos kits de participante realiza-se na Loja Verde do Est\u00e1dio Jos\u00e9 Alvalade na quinta-feira (12 de novembro), sexta-feira (13 de novembro) e s\u00e1bado (14 de novembro), sempre entre as 10:00 e as 20:00. N\u00e3o haver\u00e1 entrega de kits no domingo da prova.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como \u00e9 feita a cronometragem e o acesso aos blocos de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Apenas a Corrida de 10 km disp\u00f5e de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip descart\u00e1vel fixado no dorsal. A partida \u00e9 organizada por blocos de ritmo (Elite, Sub45, Sub50, Sub60 e +60 minutos), sendo obrigat\u00f3ria a apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o de comprovativo de tempo em prova oficial nos \u00faltimos 2 anos para acesso aos blocos mais r\u00e1pidos.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67579,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,624],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5